# Datasets, shared by both packages.
#
# `data/` sits at the repo root rather than inside eval_pipeline/ because BOTH
# packages read it and neither owns it: run_eval.py runs with CWD=eval_pipeline/
# and the GRACE training scripts run with CWD=grace_adapter/. A path of
# `../data/...` in a dataset config resolves to the same directory from either,
# which a path inside one package cannot do.
#
# Materialized images and their manifests: reproducible from a dataset config
# via `build_manifest.py`, and large.
/data/

.DS_Store
